],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and September to October and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 39 of those 75 years. In 2025, February to March came in at 52% of normal on the middle. So far in 2026, June to July sits at 65% of normal on the middle. Grid 32532 had its driest year in 1976 at 50% of normal.</p>"}
